WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.710
- Valentine's is a few days away.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.570
I know this is a big
holiday for you right?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.848
- Yes.

00:00:04.848 --> 00:00:09.690
In my country, it's the day
of the love and of friendship.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.100
So what a beautiful day.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.420
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.310
- And, in my house it's pretty big

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.260
because it's an anniversary that I have

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.100
with my husband and it's
also my daughter's Saint Day.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.193
- [Kelly] Oh, I love that.

00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:22.026
- [Audience] Aww.

00:00:22.026 --> 00:00:22.859
- Yes.

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:26.070
So it's a big day.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:29.010
- So, wait, you once got a big
surprise on Valentine's Day?

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:29.843
- [Salma] Yes.

00:00:29.843 --> 00:00:30.676
- What was it?

00:00:30.676 --> 00:00:34.530
- So, I was engaged for a long time

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:39.530
but every time it was getting
close I would chicken out.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:40.523
- Oh why?

00:00:40.523 --> 00:00:41.430
- [Salma] like three, four times?

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.350
Look, I didn't get married until I was 41,

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.290
so I always had a phobia
for the marriage thing.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.285
- Yeah.

00:00:47.285 --> 00:00:48.118
I understand.

00:00:48.118 --> 00:00:49.050
- [Salma] And so I was kind of famous

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.350
for it in my (indistinct).

00:00:51.986 --> 00:00:52.819
(Salma sighs)

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:57.440
So anyway, my husband
flew my parents secretly,

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.303
and on Valentine's Day,

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.930
they took me to the court,

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.511
like on an intervention.

00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:07.528
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:01:07.528 --> 00:01:10.506
Like, I don't like this dress.

00:01:10.506 --> 00:01:12.150
I have to get a (indistinct).

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.320
And,

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.640
they say sign!

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.810
They spoke in French.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.310
I don't know what they were saying.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.605
I was looking at (indistinct).

00:01:19.605 --> 00:01:20.438
And I did it.

00:01:20.438 --> 00:01:21.685
And that's my first wedding.

00:01:21.685 --> 00:01:23.790
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.531
Surprise wedding on Valentine's Day.

00:01:25.531 --> 00:01:26.986
(audience applauding)

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.580
Do you know I married him four times?

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.413
- What?

00:01:30.413 --> 00:01:32.097
- I've married Francois four times.

00:01:32.097 --> 00:01:33.630
- [Kelly] But what do you mean?

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.130
- Never been divorced.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.497
Because then after I was
like, ah, and I said,

00:01:38.497 --> 00:01:41.805
"Okay, I kind of like it
that I'm married now."

00:01:41.805 --> 00:01:43.140
(audience and Kelly laughing)

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.553
I wanna party.

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:48.113
(audience applauding)
And so we made a huge party.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.287
but I didn't like the cake.

00:01:51.287 --> 00:01:54.367
(Kelly laughing)
I was waking in my honeymoon.

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:58.260
"Why did I take that cake, it
looked like from outer space,

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.380
I just wanted a normal wedding cake."

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.230
And so we went on a vacation

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:07.410
and then I did a surprise wedding for him.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:08.243
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:10.620
- With a nice proper wedding cake.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.453
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:11.453 --> 00:02:12.286
- You know?
(audience laughing)

00:02:12.286 --> 00:02:13.119
And then-

00:02:13.119 --> 00:02:13.952
- Why the fourth one?

00:02:13.952 --> 00:02:17.400
- Because recently we went to
the same place with the kids

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.920
because the third one
was just with the kids.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.900
The whole family went to the same place.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:22.733
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:24.570
- And then they all surprised
me with the same thing

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.650
but reverse.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.000
Now he surprised me without-

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.380
- [Audience] Aww.
- Oh, that's nice.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:29.716
- The cake was okay.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.315
(audience laughing)
- I will say-

00:02:31.315 --> 00:02:35.148
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.029
- But I'm not a control freak.

00:02:39.029 --> 00:02:41.610
(audience laughing)
- It's actually not fair

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.470
how unbelievably talented, hot,

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:44.431
and funny you are.

00:02:44.431 --> 00:02:46.343
(Kelly and audience laughing)
It's not fair.

